ject.\n2. Superior Quality: Automatically supports native resolution and frame rate of test devices, delivering top-notch visuals and audio.\n3. Wireless Connection: Easily connect via Wi-Fi and use multiple devices on the local network.\n4. Multi-Platform Support: Covers iOS, Android, PadOS and VR.\n5. Security: Prevents unauthorized access through verification codes.\n\n**Why Modoium?**\n- Time-Saving: Escape the endless cycle of building, installing, and testing.\n- Increased Productivity: Speed up development with instant feedback.\n- Improved Quality: Verify exact performance on real devices.\n- Cost-Effective: Reduce the need for multiple test devices.\n\nUpgrade your Unity development experience with Modoium. Start now!", "short_description": "Modoium is a Unity mobile game development test acceleration tool. Connect to Unity Editor via Wi-Fi for instant testing, and save build-copy-install time to focus on improving your game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://modoium.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Clicked, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://modoium.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9055615047793144"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.c